    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to bring the impressive 1 Dunloe Avenue to the market. This three-bedroom, semi-detached home is located in the heart of Navan. The property occupies a prominent position at the front of the estate overlooking a green area and has benefitted from the recently completed Clonmagadden bypass which provides convenient access to the M3 motorway.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in pristine condition throughout and has been exceptionally well maintained and upgraded to a very high standard by its current owners. The ground floor features a bright entrance hallway, living room, a utility room, guest WC and a modern open-plan kitchen/dining area. The first floor comprises three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with an ensuite, built-in wardrobes, and a family bathroom. The layout provides generous living space throughout. To the rear is a impressive private enclosed garden, which includes an stove powered hot tub, garden pod, and a block built shed suitable for a variety of purposes. \r\n\r\n1 Dunloe Avenue is within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, including Aura Leisure Centre, Blackwater Park and Navan Shopping Centre. The location also offers convenient access to shops, leisure facilities, public transport, and schools such as St Pauls Primary School and St. Patrick's Classical School. The property is ideal for commuters, with only a 35-minute drive to Blanchardstown, approximately 50 minutes to Dublin Airport, and 50 minutes to Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
